  "body": "To download the documents for this property, copy and paste the following link into your browser: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/PBG3\r\n\r\nWith a move to the South Island on the horizon, our owners are ready for their next chapter, creating a fantastic opportunity for someone new to call this beautiful Red Beach property home.\r\n\r\nTucked away within an exclusive, secure gated enclave, this solidly constructed freehold home offers the perfect balance of space, privacy and easy-care coastal living. Whether you're looking for a family home, downsizing without compromising on comfort, or searching for a lock-and-leave lifestyle, this one certainly ticks the boxes.\r\n\r\nBuilt from concrete block with a stylish rendered finish, the home has a timeless Mediterranean-inspired charm. Step through the formal entrance and discover generous open-plan living and dining spaces, with an entertainer's kitchen at the heart of it all. Four sets of French doors open out to multiple patio areas, making indoor/outdoor living and entertaining an absolute breeze.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor also offers a double internal-access garage, guest WC and a spacious home office that could easily serve as a fourth bedroom. Outside, the fully fenced grounds provide a private, secure setting for children and pets to enjoy.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, you'll find three well-appointed bedrooms and two bathrooms, including a lovely master retreat complete with walk-in wardrobe, ensuite and its own private deck. There's even a little glimpse of the sea to enjoy with your morning coffee!\r\n\r\nThe established gardens are another highlight, featuring fruit trees and productive vegetable gardens for those who enjoy a little time outdoors. Equally, the property lends itself beautifully to those wanting a more relaxed, low-maintenance lifestyle.\r\n\r\nWhat makes this enclave particularly special is its welcoming sense of community. Neighbours are known to gather for casual Friday drinks in the shared spaces, offering a friendly atmosphere that's not always easy to find.\r\n\r\nWith no Body Corporate fees, just a modest monthly contribution to the incorporated society for maintaining the landscaped gardens, you'll enjoy the benefits of this beautifully presented setting without the usual costs. Secure gated access, visitor parking and a peaceful green outlook add to the appeal.\r\n\r\nAnd the location? You're just minutes from Red Beach, Orewa Beach, Silverdale Shopping Centre and motorway connections, keeping everything you need within easy reach.\r\n\r\nOur owners have their sights set on the South Island, and their plans to relocate are moving forward. If you've been waiting for the right opportunity in Red Beach, now is the time to come and take a look!",
